[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 24189.03, "timestamp": "06:43:09", "text": "那。等等，我忘了在YouTube上，你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24192.468, "timestamp": "06:43:12", "text": "可以说就是那把剑。哦，忘了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24194.548, "timestamp": "06:43:14", "text": "你知道，上次直播是在……我的上一次直播。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24197.708, "timestamp": "06:43:17", "text": "在你的 Twitch 上直播"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24201.91, "timestamp": "06:43:21", "text": "喵。等等，实际上是Zuki Zuki"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24205.35, "timestamp": "06:43:25", "text": "不小心说出了剑，溪流"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24208.31, "timestamp": "06:43:28", "text": "单词。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24210.31, "timestamp": "06:43:30", "text": "我很高兴什么事都没发生，但是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24219.19, "timestamp": "06:43:39", "text": "猫。他创作了《摇摆的帽子》。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24221.91, "timestamp": "06:43:41", "text": "点燃爆炸帽，就像我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24230.43, "timestamp": "06:43:50", "text": "帕佩。我的天哪。如何处置"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24234.23, "timestamp": "06:43:54", "text": "这？唉，真是个坏儿子。是的。哦。是的。还，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24235.708, "timestamp": "06:43:55", "text": "谢谢你给我打电话"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24239.67, "timestamp": "06:43:59", "text": "昨天虽然我没醒"}]